=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Brutus} as a level 40 or higher {p:Beastmaster}.

>**From this point on, you can complete the quest on any job.**
* Kill monsters on the 7th to 10th floor of {z:Upper Delkfutt's Tower} until you get a {i:Delkfutt Chest Key|Delkfutt Chest Key|1036}
** Alternatively, you can purchase one from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}.
* Use the key to open a chest in the zone to receive a {k:Guiding bell}.
* Return to {n:Brutus} for your reward.

=4 **{c=red:Note:}**
